Dialogue: 3,0:22:20.44,0:22:30.62,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\bord1.5\3c&HAC9E8B&\pos(1780,940)\an3}这个特殊的日子里  多想陪伴在你身边
Dialogue: 3,0:22:30.62,0:22:35.71,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\bord1.5\3c&HAC9E8B&\pos(140,940)\an1}在花荫下独自等候
Dialogue: 3,0:22:35.71,0:22:41.05,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\bord1.5\3c&HAC9E8B&\pos(1780,940)\an3}你却始终没有到来
Dialogue: 3,0:22:41.05,0:22:51.39,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\bord1.5\3c&HAC9E8B&\pos(140,940)\an1}难道全身都成了心
Dialogue: 3,0:22:51.39,0:22:56.86,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\bord1.5\3c&HAC9E8B&\pos(1780,940)\an3}残酷痛楚难以忍受
Dialogue: 3,0:22:56.86,0:23:01.82,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\bord1.5\3c&HAC9E8B&\pos(1780,940)\an3}疼到让我发不出声
Dialogue: 3,0:23:01.82,0:23:05.45,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\bord1.5\3c&HAC9E8B&\pos(960,940)\an2}疼到让我想要消失
Dialogue: 3,0:23:09.78,0:23:12.33,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\bord1.5}樱花凋零  片片飞舞
Dialogue: 3,0:23:12.33,0:23:16.04,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\bord1.5}我永远在苦苦等待
Dialogue: 3,0:23:16.04,0:23:19.09,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\bord1.5}渴望得到你的温暖
Dialogue: 3,0:23:20.25,0:23:23.01,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\bord1.5}我最讨厌流下眼泪
Dialogue: 3,0:23:23.01,0:23:26.26,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\bord1.5}生怕被人看出悲伤
Dialogue: 3,0:23:26.26,0:23:29.55,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\bord1.5}将它深深锁在体内
Dialogue: 3,0:23:30.43,0:23:30.97,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HAC9E8B&\blur6\bord1.5}快了，
Dialogue: 3,0:23:30.97,0:23:33.18,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HAC9E8B&\blur6\bord1.5}樱花凋零  片片飞舞
